# Local build/scratch concerns for docker-context-gui only.
#
# PHI and secret rules for this directory (uploaded_*/, received/,
# seg_results/, uids_logs/, nifti_inputs/, audit_logs/,
# flask_sessions/, *.csv, client_secrets.json, .env) live in the repo-root
# .gitignore, so PHI policy has one place to audit. Do not re-add them here.
#
# Several of those directories no longer have any code reading them -- the
# upload and segmentation-viewer pages that wrote them are gone. The ignore
# rules stay anyway: an existing deployment can still have patient data
# sitting in them, and an ignore rule is the cheap side of that bet.

# Virtualenvs / tooling
.venv/
venv/
.zencoder/
